# A Varka ally of level 2 with 7 PKs, holding 5000 adena and the level 3 Ketra mark, wearing the
# Pipette Knife, signed up for Dusk while Dusk leads the festival: the probe's page shows each.
# The defaults and a tied competition are in ketra_holdings.scenario.
character Varka 40
standing -2
pk 7
hold 57 5000
hold 7213 1
equip 4665
cabal dusk avarice
festival 10 250
script test.HoldingsProbe
item 7213 4665
npc probe 30002 Folk 10 0 0

action probe
action probe
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=probe item=0 html="<html><body>standing=-2 pk=7 mark=1 adena=5000 weapon=4665 cabal=DUSK winning=DUSK losing=DAWN</body></html>"
  S ActionFailed
  items 57=5000 7213=1 4665=1
